<title>POLAND: AGROS JAN GROUP NET FALLS TO PLN 2.4 MLN.</title>
<headline>AGROS JAN GROUP NET FALLS TO PLN 2.4 MLN.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-02-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary results January </p>
<p>(in million zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>JANUARY</p>
<p> Net profit	     0.77 vs   2.18</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	 0.98 vs   2.71</p>
<p> Operating profit     0.62 vs   1.42</p>
<p> Sales		    8.40 vs  15.51</p>
<p>JANUARY</p>
<p> Group net profit	     2.40 vs   3.61</p>
<p> Group pre-tax profit	 5.18 vs   5.02</p>
<p> Group operating profit     8.21 vs   4.94</p>
<p> Group sales		  108.95 vs  86.45</p>
<p>Note. Full name of the Polish food trader and producer is</p>
<p>Agros Holding SA.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
